OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADentists issue warnings about
OL,4,Aillegal 'pop up' events in hotels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dentist says he's "deeply concerned"
OL,7,Fby illegal dental tourism "pop-up"
OL,8,Fconsultations in Northern Irish hotels,
OL,9,Fwhich aren't properly registered.
OL,11,FPaul Brennan, the chair of the Northern
OL,12,FIreland branch of the British Dental
OL,13,FAssociation (BDA), says patients'
OL,14,Fmouths are often examined at these
OL,15,Fevents, which constitutes the "practice
OL,16,Fof dentistry".
OL,18,FThe BDA has warned that when dentistry
OL,19,Foccurs and the hotels and dentists
OL,20,Faren't registered with their
OL,21,Fregulators, it can amount to "illegal
OL,22,Fpractice".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
